@startuml
title Sleep Health Research - UML Sequence Diagram

actor "Research Analyst" as Analyst
participant Streamlit
participant "LangGraph workflow" as Graph
participant "Router select()" as Router
participant "Research research()" as Research
participant "LangChain RAG tool" as RAG
database ChromaDB
participant "Reflective worker reflect()" as Reflect
participant "Scope reply" as Scope

Analyst -> Streamlit: Submit question
Streamlit -> Graph: invoke({question})
Graph -> Router: select(state)

alt General sleep question
    Router --> Graph: Route to research
    Graph -> Research: research(state)
    Research -> RAG: Retrieve evidence(question)
    RAG -> ChromaDB: Search indexed passages
    ChromaDB --> RAG: Matching records
    RAG --> Research: Evidence with citation IDs
    Research --> Graph: Evidence and extractive draft
    Graph -> Reflect: reflect(state)

    alt Evidence matches draft
        Reflect --> Graph: Cited answer and evidence matched
    else No relevant evidence
        Reflect --> Graph: Insufficient evidence; withhold answer
    else Draft does not match evidence
        Reflect --> Graph: Unsupported draft; withhold answer
    end

else Outside scope or blocked personal wording
    Router --> Graph: Route to scope_reply
    Graph -> Scope: Create scope response
    Scope --> Graph: Outside-scope verdict and message
end

Graph --> Streamlit: Final workflow state
Streamlit --> Analyst: Display verdict and response

@enduml
